# ── Local Database & model artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────
# The SQLite database contains your 5-year historical data. It is large,
# local-only, and should never be committed. NOTE: data/ is now a real source
# package (data layer), so we ignore the binary artifacts that live in it rather
# than the whole directory.
data/commodities.db
data/meta_predictor.pkl
data/sector_params.json
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.pkl

